{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fast Pira Trip 是一款以離線運作為核心的行程規劃工具，特別適合重視私隱、又不願花大量時間編排行程的旅客。用家只要輸入目的地、旅行日期、節奏與風格，即可自動整理出逐日安排與出發前準備清單。軟件現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，所有資料只存放於本機，無需註冊帳號，亦不設訂閱或廣告。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-26.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>離線生成逐日行程</h2>\n\n\n<p>設定目的地、旅行日期、節奏與風格後，軟件即時生成完整每日行程，並列出出發前任務與行李清單。介面分為五個部分，可切換不同旅程、在地圖查看已儲存地點、對照日曆確認時間，並集中記錄支出、預訂與筆記。行程可匯出至系統日曆，無需註冊帳號即可使用。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-411-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-412-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-413-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-414-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-415-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-416-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fast Pira Trip</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fast-pira-trip/id6817299104?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.549191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"c1f41637a487b2a43fa16ffbda6588ff37c922a9755c2571c80242f4ec2285bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}